        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silver, from lead production, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silver, from lead production, at refinery
Production of refined silver (99.9%) from Parkes crust from lead desilvering.;
CAS number: 007440-22-4; 
UUID: eb8b7e1a-fdbd-36d4-a0fe-9fdf215851c4
Procesing of raw material from lead desilvering, infrastructure, electricity and process emissions to air.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Processing of Parkes desilvering crust by hot pressing, dezincing (vacuum distillation), cupellation of lead and moebius electrolysis (electrowinning)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: see Geography and Technology
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_eb8b7e1a-fdbd-36d4-a0fe-9fdf215851c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
